  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Climate Change and Security Dialogues</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The action will convene and support dialogue processes permitting wider engagement with stakeholders in hot-spot regions vulnerable to climate and environment related risks to peace and security, and which may currently receive less attention in the field of climate and security. This knowledge production will encourage greater knowledge exchange between partners within regions and between affected populations on effectively addressing climate security risks.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
